{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}HtmlToWord — JSON configuration (Symfony 7){% endblock %}

{% block body %}
  <header class="rounded-3 border border-primary border-opacity-25 shadow-sm mb-4 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="bg-primary bg-opacity-10 px-4 py-3 border-bottom border-primary border-opacity-25">
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-start justify-content-between gap-3">
        <div>
          <p class="text-uppercase small text-primary fw-semibold mb-2">HtmlToWordBundle · demo page</p>
          <h1 class="h2 mb-2 text-dark">Custom profile &amp; HTML</h1>
          <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">
            Symfony 7 · típico URL local <code>http://localhost:8020/custom-config</code>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-end">
          <span class="badge text-bg-primary fs-6">/custom-config</span>
          <p class="small text-body-secondary mt-2 mb-0">Exportación <code>.docx</code> vía <code>convertWithOptions</code> / <code>convertWithInlineProfile</code></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-body-tertiary">
      <p class="lead small mb-0">
        Misma forma que una entrada bajo <code>nowo_html_to_word.profiles</code> en YAML. Pega lo que guardarías
        en base de datos (columna JSON) o usa para pruebas.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="alert alert-secondary small mb-4">
    <p class="mb-2"><strong>Merge with YAML</strong> — <code>convertWithOptions($html, $options, $profile)</code>:
      merge order = YAML <code>default</code> profile + selected named profile + your JSON (deepest wins).</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><strong>This config only</strong> — <code>convertWithInlineProfile($html, $options)</code>:
      no YAML merge; use when the full profile lives in a database.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card mb-4 border-primary-subtle">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h2 class="h5 card-title">Cabecera y pie en el Word</h2>
      <p class="small mb-2">Las claves son las mismas que en <code>nowo_html_to_word.profiles.*</code> del bundle:</p>
      <ul class="small mb-0">
        <li><code>header</code>: <code>enabled</code>, <code>text</code>, <code>logo</code> (ruta absoluta a raster), <code>logo_width</code> (px CSS), <code>show_page_number</code>, <code>different_first_page</code>.</li>
        <li><code>footer</code>: <code>enabled</code>, <code>text</code>, <code>show_page_number</code> (PhpWord inserta el campo de página con <code>{PAGE}</code>), <code>different_first_page</code>.</li>
        <li>En JSON pegado en el navegador <strong>no</strong> se resuelve <code>%kernel.project_dir%</code>: el ejemplo precargado usa ya la ruta absoluta al logo del demo.</li>
        <li>Perfil YAML <code>membrete</code> en la demo principal reproduce el mismo concepto sin pasar por este formulario.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card mb-4 border-secondary-subtle">
    <div class="row g-0 align-items-center">
      <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3 text-center p-3 bg-body-secondary">
        <img src="{{ asset('demo-assets/demo-logo.png') }}" alt="Sample logo used in DOCX header when configured" class="img-fluid rounded border bg-white p-2" width="160" height="160" style="max-height: 140px; width: auto;">
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-8 col-lg-9">
        <div class="card-body py-3">
          <h2 class="h6 mb-2">Sample header logo (web + DOCX)</h2>
          <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">
            Static file <code>public/demo-assets/demo-logo.png</code>. Profiles such as <code>membrete</code> reference it via
            <code>header.logo</code>; HtmlToWordBundle embeds it in the Word header when the path is readable and the bytes look like PNG/JPEG/GIF/WebP.
            Body HTML below can still include <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> tags — those are independent from this logo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <form method="post" action="{{ path('demo_custom_config') }}" class="mb-4">
    <fieldset class="border rounded p-3 mb-3">
      <legend class="float-none w-auto px-2 fs-6">Mode</legend>
      <div class="form-check">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="mode" id="mode-merge" value="merge" checked>
        <label class="form-check-label" for="mode-merge">Merge JSON on top of YAML profiles (pick base profile)</label>
      </div>
      <div class="form-check">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="mode" id="mode-inline" value="inline">
        <label class="form-check-label" for="mode-inline">JSON only (inline / typical DB) — <code>convertWithInlineProfile</code></label>
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <div class="row g-3 mb-3" id="profile-row">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <label for="profile" class="form-label">YAML profile (merge mode only)</label>
        <select class="form-select" id="profile" name="profile">
          {% for p in profiles %}
            <option value="{{ p }}" {% if p == default_profile %}selected{% endif %}>{{ p }}</option>
          {% endfor %}
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <label for="html-field" class="form-label">HTML</label>
    <p class="form-text small mb-1">Default content: long multi-page sample (tables, lists, quotes, <code>pre</code>, typography, <code>page-break</code>).</p>
    <textarea class="form-control font-monospace small mb-3" id="html-field" name="html" rows="28" spellcheck="false">{{ default_custom_config_html|raw }}</textarea>

    <label for="config-json" class="form-label">Configuración JSON (cabecera / pie / export)</label>
    <textarea class="form-control font-monospace small mb-2" id="config-json" name="config_json" rows="22" spellcheck="false" required>{{ header_footer_demo_json }}</textarea>
    <p class="form-text mb-2">Plantilla inicial: overlay con <code>header</code>, <code>footer</code> y <code>export.filename</code>. Modifica textos, quita el logo o cambia el perfil base en modo merge.</p>
    <details class="small mb-3">
      <summary class="fw-medium">Referencia: JSON mínimo del perfil YAML «{{ default_profile }}» (solo lo que exporta la config)</summary>
      <pre class="bg-body-secondary p-2 rounded mt-2 mb-0 font-monospace">{{ sample_config_json }}</pre>
    </details>

    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Download .docx</button>
    <a href="{{ path('demo_home') }}" class="btn btn-outline-secondary ms-2">Back to main demo</a>
  </form>

  <footer class="mt-5 pt-4 border-top border-secondary-subtle">
    <div class="row g-3 align-items-center text-body-secondary small">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <p class="mb-1 fw-medium text-body">Pie de página de la demo (solo web, no es el del Word)</p>
        <p class="mb-0">
          <span class="text-decoration-none">HtmlToWordBundle</span> — pruebas de perfil JSON y HTML en Symfony 7.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 text-md-end">
        <p class="mb-2">
          <a href="{{ path('demo_home') }}">Demo principal</a>
          <span class="text-muted mx-1">·</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/nowo-tech/HtmlToWordBundle" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0 font-monospace">localhost:8020 · ruta <code>demo_custom_config</code></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    function syncProfileRow() {
      const inline = document.getElementById('mode-inline').checked;
      document.getElementById('profile-row').style.display = inline ? 'none' : '';
      const sel = document.getElementById('profile');
      if (sel) { sel.disabled = inline; }
    }
    document.getElementById('mode-merge').addEventListener('change', syncProfileRow);
    document.getElementById('mode-inline').addEventListener('change', syncProfileRow);
    syncProfileRow();
  </script>
{% endblock %}
